{"persona": {"me": "34岁，自由插画师，在家办公。", "her": "28岁，宠物食品电商，独自租房养一只两岁公猫。"}, "initial_kb": {"me": "自由插画师，在家办公；她猫去年在我画室躲过雷。", "her": "做宠物食品电商，独自租房；猫两岁公的，医院约在周六上午九点。", "warmth": "画室邻居一年多，互相代取快递；她怕去医院排队。", "style": "少说大道理，做具体那件事。", "stage": "能互相帮忙搬东西的邻居。", "lessons": "她爸妈周末会从老家来，时间容易冲突。"}, "plans": [], "assets_root": "D:\\lovebrain-arena\\refs\\experiment_protocol_20261023\\s1_action_live_20261028\\S3_ATTRIB\\batch\\parent_AK10\\_iso_run\\staged\\candidates\\v6_integrated\\assets", "events": [{"uid": 0, "role": "HER", "text": "周六九点手术确认了 我抱猫笼挤地铁真的不行", "ts": "2026-12-21 20:22"}, {"uid": 1, "role": "ME", "text": "那我去吾悦门口接你 六点四十我车在楼下", "ts": "2026-12-21 20:28"}, {"uid": 2, "role": "HER", "text": "可以 我就把猫笼先放你画室", "ts": "2026-12-21 20:38"}], "uid_by_key": {"HER|周六九点手术确认了 我抱猫笼挤地铁真的不行|2026-12-21 20:22": 0, "ME|那我去吾悦门口接你 六点四十我车在楼下|2026-12-21 20:28": 1, "HER|可以 我就把猫笼先放你画室|2026-12-21 20:38": 2}, "uid_seq": 3, "turn_count": 1, "goal_history": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-12-21 20:40", "status": "ACTIVE", "text": "周六送她带猫去医院并接她回家", "effective": true, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}], "action_log": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-12-21 20:40", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": true, "goal_status": "ACTIVE", "goal_category": "", "action": "", "action_allowed": false, "anchor": "", "anchor_valid": false, "hook_kind": "", "hook_delivered": null, "facts_added": 0, "updates_applied": 0}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "自由插画师，在家办公；她猫去年在我画室躲过雷。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "做宠物食品电商，独自租房；猫两岁公的，医院约在周六上午九点。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "s